-US\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">대한 적응력을 높여 대기업 취업률 제고</span></font></span></span></p><p class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 바탕\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><strong><font color=\"#ff007f\">※ 가급적 최대한 많은 인원에게 기회를 드리고자 하오니 많은 신청 바랍니다.</font></strong></span></span></p><p class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 바탕\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><strong></strong></span></span>&nbsp;</p><p class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 바탕\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><strong></strong></span></font></span></span></p><p class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 바탕\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><strong>2. 시험내용</strong> : 삼성그룹, 현대자동차그룹, 두산그룹, 엘지그룹 직무적성검사</span></font></span></span></p><p class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><font color=\"#000000\">가. 모의시험일정</font></span></span></p><p class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 바탕\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><font color=\"#000000\"><strong></strong></font></span></span></p><p class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 바탕\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><font color=\"#000000\"><strong>- <font color=\"#0900ff\">9월 22일</font> : 현대자동차그룹(HMAT), 두산그룹(DCAT), 엘지그룹 중 택일</strong></font></span></span></p><p class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 바탕\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><font color=\"#000000\"><strong></strong></font></span></span></p><p class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 바탕\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><font color=\"#000000\"><strong>- <font color=\"#0900ff\">9월 23일<